Bind Npc 31551 Zone 2
Quest 623 "Subjugation of the Goblin Village I"
    Journal "You must perform mission with [Goblin Subjugation Squad] Welz."
    Kill 20 of 2901, 2951

Requires player level >= 60 and player is elmorad and quest 621 is completed

Rewards
    Give 12500000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "Master, let's help [Goblin Subjugation Squad] and start fighting Goblins!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "You are here, <selfname>. The number of Kobold inhabiting in Goblin villages has been growing exponentially."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "It is clear that if Kobold continues to expand, they will take over this entire land to make it their habitat if we do nothing.  Would you help me?\n\nWells and the need to fight against Kobold El Morad region goblins near the village of [Goblin Squad]."

On in_progress
    Say "There are just too many of them. Let's do a little better this time."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have done well/Goob job."
